  "notes": [
    {
      "at": [
        -30,
        -26
      ],
      "id": 15,
      "text": "Joystick module (KY-023 style) on a Blue Pill.\nThe module runs from 3.3 V: the Blue Pill's analog inputs do not take 5 V.\nWhile running, drag the stick (it springs back to the center), click the SW square to push it,\nor use the wheel (X) and Shift with the wheel (Y).\nAnalyzer > UART: \"X <code> Y <code> SW <0|1> <direction>\" every 200 ms; the board's LED lights while SW is pushed."
    }
  ],
